WEBVTT

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.640
Two hundred and fifteen minutes on the flight, eight hundred and...

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:19.880
MISTAKA!

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:30.700
You're Heller?

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.390
That is correct, yes.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.490
If you will please to follow me, Mr. Hull.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:40.260
Yes, you are undoubtedly Mr. Harry Rude.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:23.320
your pockets, please. Give me one reason why I should. Mr. Rule, my instructions are that you

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:25.570
are to be searched. Let us waste no more time.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.080
you, Mr. Rule, that the driver is in radio

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.780
contact without...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:06.650
We will know if anybody tries to follow, and the consequences will be regrettable.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.820
You have yourself a headache, Mr. Rule.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.460
You have no hope of memorizing a route.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:59.980
I'm clear, Paul, but they're going around...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.240
circles yes they're running them all over town keep listening over right out

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:46.750
This is it, what do you read?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.870
Two, one, three.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:50.310
Got you.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.520
You will please to follow me.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:27.350
Enter.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:37.100
Good evening, Mr. Rule. May I congratulate you on surviving my little test so admirably?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:37.800
Who are you?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.930
Always forgetting we dealt through hell are.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.680
Forgive me. My name is Bella Carolian.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.660
Carolian? Armaments.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:54.030
Yes, Mr. Rule. Armaments and steel and chemicals and a great many other things too tedious to mention.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:59.140
I hope you will understand now that I have to protect myself.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.550
You're the original recluse.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.030
You've been hiding out for, what, 20 years?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.640
I have, perhaps, an exaggerated value for privacy.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:14.070
You have read the court transcript and the other documents that Teller sent you?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:15.140
Yeah.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:21.120
You'll agree that the trial was a travesty, a completely trumped-up charge?

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:22.190
Looks that way.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:29.400
Well, Mr. Rule, the man now languishing in jail on a totally false charge is my brother, Chantal.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:29.780
So?

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:34.120
Let me explain further. My brother, unlike me, is an idealist.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:38.090
All his life he has been involved in political trouble somewhere.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:46.150
This does not interest me in the least, but what does concern me is that my brother has been put in prison.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:52.520
Now, Mr. Ruler, I want you to get him out. For this, I will pay you a quarter of a million dollars.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:54.380
Negative.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.200
What is this?

00:07:58.640 --> 00:07:59.980
Look, I'm sorry for your brother.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.360
but another jailbreaker so if you'll excuse me please do not go oh marie my dear i did not hear

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:16.380
you come in this is my wife marie i'm afraid my husband has not told you the whole story

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:23.310
this is not the first time that chandor has been imprisoned for his political beliefs

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:29.720
the first time was 1941 and the prison was dachau

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.080
Shandor is a sick man.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:36.020
If we do not get him out of prison soon, he may die.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:39.030
I beg you to help us.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.580
Where's the prison?

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:12.180
shouldn't have any trouble with the prison governor. Athens is anxious to improve its

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:19.350
public image abroad. What we are doing is good, and Shandok Aruleon is a fine man.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:20.680
Time.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:22.980
We'll be here.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:24.640
It's time to stop.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.780
Margaret Mandeville from the Red Cross prison survey team.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:48.880
Your pass, please.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:56.740
It is in order.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:57.890
The governor will see you.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:07.360
My dear Lady Mandeville, this is indeed a great pleasure.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:13.710
My superiors in Athens have told me of your work, and I am most anxious to help you.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.920
I believe there are no restrictions on which prisoners I may interview?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.340
Oh, none, none whatsoever.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:25.420
We have nothing to hide, Lady Mandeville, contrary to what they say in the foreign press.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.490
I may be able to help you there.

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.890
Ah, we would be so great.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:34.330
Ah, this is Sergeant Panides. He will escort you.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:46.040
The first will be Yanis Koufoulis.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.500
That is correct. An extremist.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:23.350
Yes, sir.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.890
He doesn't appear to be here.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.070
I do hope he hasn't escaped.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.140
Impossible.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.360
Why is this prisoner out of his cell?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:04.250
Medical wing, routine check-up.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:08.650
Dental treatment.

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.230
My apologies.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.350
You may interview the prisoner now.

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:12.910
Thank you.

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:29.900
Come to get you out of here.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.590
Listen carefully. We have very little time.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.330
I understand. Who are you?

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.490
It doesn't matter who I am. Do you want to get out of here?

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:38.530
Yes, of course, but...

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:44.490
Listen carefully. You will be taken out of here by helicopter at exactly five o'clock.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.180
Ten seconds before five, these bars will blow out.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.990
When the bars are gone, the helicopter will land on the parapet.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.270
Get on that helicopter and hang on.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:57.050
But how will we get off the island?

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.490
We have a yacht.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:09.460
It's set.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:16.740
Good luck.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:46.750
Where's your watch?

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:47.470
What?

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.750
I didn't have a watch.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.960
But Lady Mandelville, I particularly noticed it.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:55.480
I insist on knowing where it is.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.160
You're so stupid of me.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:13:59.100
You're quite right.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:13:59.680
I must have...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:04.040
it in my handbag. When you've visited as many prisons as I have, you learn to take precautions.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.700
I hope you were not trying to slip away without saying goodbye.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.400
You must take a glass of wine with me.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:36.500
I really do have a most blessing.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.520
But I must insist.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:14.800
governor i congratulate you but now i really must be on my way oh if you must

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:19.770
you must dear lady it has been a great honor to entertain you

00:17:19.548 --> 00:17:21.228
Any sign of life for my friend yet?

00:17:21.724 --> 00:17:23.644
Not yet. He slept around the clock.

00:17:23.784 --> 00:17:24.764
Paul was taking care of him.

00:17:26.524 --> 00:17:27.184
I did very well.

00:17:27.996 --> 00:17:28.656
Thank you.

00:17:33.548 --> 00:17:34.448
Well, here he is.

00:17:34.768 --> 00:17:37.668
Ah, Mr. Carolian, I hope you're feeling better.

00:17:37.908 --> 00:17:39.068
Thank you, I'm feeling much better.

00:17:39.788 --> 00:17:41.868
Well, I think we should drink to your freedom.

00:17:42.284 --> 00:17:43.504
I drink to Lady Mandeville,

00:17:43.624 --> 00:17:45.024
prison reformer extraordinaire.

00:17:45.384 --> 00:17:46.524
Poor Margaret Mandeville,

00:17:46.624 --> 00:17:47.644
she'll never live this down.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.040
You mean there really is a lady, man?

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.700
Of course, she's my cousin.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:53.780
Mr. Rule.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:54.920
Oh, thank you.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.360
Your friend has told me who you are.

00:17:59.244 --> 00:17:59.984
But...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.380
He's told me nothing of

00:18:01.788 --> 00:18:03.968
Why you've organized my escape.

00:18:05.596 --> 00:18:06.776
We were hired by your brother.

00:18:13.148 --> 00:18:14.868
and you might just as well turn around.

00:18:15.548 --> 00:18:16.748
Take me straight back to prison.

00:18:18.428 --> 00:18:19.468
What do you mean?

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:24.740
Who do you suppose had been imprisoned on that trumped-up charge in the first place?

00:18:25.468 --> 00:18:26.068
My brother.

00:18:26.588 --> 00:18:27.668
He wants me out of the way.

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:36.620
I'm one of the few men who know that behind that respectable facade of the Carolean Corporation,

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:42.260
Bella is running the biggest illegal drug operation in the world.

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:43.320
Can you prove that?

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.970
Yes, I can prove it.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.380
of it. I was, after all, Bella's partner

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.680
for the last 20 years.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:56.410
It seems I'm not to have the chance.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.840
He had undoubtedly decided to

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.780
silence me.

00:19:01.596 --> 00:19:02.676
once and for all.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:04.940
Roll in, rule.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:06.440
Yeah, we got him.

00:19:07.388 --> 00:19:08.988
He's been telling us some interesting things.

00:19:09.884 --> 00:19:11.604
Look, I'm not arguing with you, I'm telling you.

00:19:12.188 --> 00:19:14.388
And we dock in Barcelona in about 12 hours.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:16.760
We don't move until we get a few explanations.

00:19:25.532 --> 00:19:26.372
and nothing.

00:19:27.772 --> 00:19:28.692
We will see.

00:19:50.796 --> 00:19:52.996
Making a terrible mistake, Mr. Rule.

00:19:54.188 --> 00:19:55.228
Bella is ruthless.

00:19:56.652 --> 00:19:58.392
If we remain here, we wait.

00:20:12.124 --> 00:20:14.724
forcing

00:20:15.452 --> 00:20:16.072
Mr. Roo?

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:59.980
Beside all of you that I was telling the truth, Mr. Rule.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:01.810
Well, I had to be sure.

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:02.520
And now?

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.890
Carolian, I bet you're surprised.

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:13.060
Oh, here's another surprise.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.340
I've changed my mind.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.660
We're going ahead as arranged.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:18.280
Right.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:24.450
But you have to prove.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.670
We hand you over tonight as arranged.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:50.880
Good evening, Mr. Rule.

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:52.540
You got the money?

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:33.460
Okay, let's go.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:38.240
Well, Shandor, I imagine you know I brought you here.

00:22:38.980 --> 00:22:42.710
Yes, Bella, you want to murder me.

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.800
Yes, of course, naturally, I'm going to kill you.

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:48.770
But it is a little more subtle than that.

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:52.240
Because of your damned idealistic meddling,

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.140
it is only a matter of time before others find out about the activities of the Carolian Corporation.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.560
I have therefore decided to die.

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:03.720
And you're going to help me.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:06.510
You're going to play substitute for me.

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:08.610
Or at least your corpses.

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.460
But, Bella, you'll never get away with it.

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:15.370
We are brothers, yes, but...

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:19.010
But not identical twins, that thought had occurred to me.

00:23:19.300 --> 00:23:23.280
Oh, I can assure you the corpse will be quite unrecognizable.

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:28.270
Do you know what a shotgun does to a man's face?

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.830
What about fingerprints?

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:35.810
Oh, but I am a respectable businessman.

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:38.400
There are no records of my prints.

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:41.730
Can you think of any other snags?

00:23:43.220 --> 00:23:44.300
Blood group, for instance.

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:46.940
I've been very thorough.

00:23:47.180 --> 00:23:48.520
We have the same blood group.

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:52.880
There are, of course, medical records.

00:23:54.050 --> 00:23:55.070
Teeth, for instance.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.500
A conclusive method of identification.

00:23:59.490 --> 00:23:59.970
But I've been...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.090
I believe that you have recently been to the dentist in prison.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.880
You see, I've thought of everything.

00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:10.160
It is perfect.

00:24:26.170 --> 00:24:26.590
Flour!

00:24:29.640 --> 00:24:29.780
Congratulations.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:34.270
It was a terrific performance. Unfortunately, your leading man is off stage.

00:24:40.610 --> 00:24:41.850
Extremely grateful, Mr. Rule.

00:24:50.200 --> 00:24:54.570
No, you have a dangerous sense of the dramatic, Mr. Rule.

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:56.450
I had a little trouble reading the map.

00:24:56.910 --> 00:24:57.330
That's right.

00:24:57.940 --> 00:24:59.390
Madame la Conteste, thank you.

00:25:07.740 --> 00:25:09.930
Relax, this one really is perfume.

00:25:32.300 --> 00:25:34.060
In the end of
